# ─── Ignore everything, then opt in what makes the repo shareable ───
# Bonus: build output & dependencies (node_modules, .svelte-kit, …)
# stay out for free — nothing is tracked unless explicitly opted in.
#
# NOTE: git does not support inline comments — a '#' only starts a
# comment at the start of a line. Keep every rule on its own line.
*

# Let git descend into subdirs (nested files stay ignored until listed)
!*/

# Hard-ignore generated/dependency/editor dirs (after !*/ so they win;
# nothing inside can be re-included by the opt-ins below)
node_modules/
.svelte-kit/
.wrangler/
build/
dist/
.claude/
.vscode/
.artifacts/

# ─── Opt back in: shareable source & config ───
!.gitignore
!.prettierignore
!.npmrc
!.node-version
!.tool-versions
!.env.example
!README.md
!LICENSE
!package.json
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!pnpm-lock.yaml
# CI workflows and any other YAML config. pnpm-workspace.yaml was named individually before
# this rule existed; it is left listed above because a reader looking for it should find it.
!*.yml
!*.yaml
!*.config.js
!*.config.ts
!tsconfig*.json
!*.svelte
!*.ts
!*.js
!*.mjs
!*.css
!*.svg
!*.webp
# Baked share cards (static/og), from scripts/gen-og.mjs. PNG because that is what an
# unfurler will render — webp support across them is not reliable.
!*.png
!*.woff2
!*.html
!*.md
# data & manifests
!*.json
!*.geojson

# ─── Dev-only: re-ignore AFTER opt-ins so these win ───
# your underscore convention (_PLAN.md, _NOTES.md, …)
_*
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
# review/QA artifacts like dotcom-2's _review-checklist.*
*review-checklist*
